## Fail-closed precursor

The first frozen candidate returned `RETAINED_DATABASE_QUERY_RED`. Its database
transaction rolled back, no result artifact was written, the retained counts
remained 1 community row, 3 lifecycle events, and 14 latency rows, and both
append-only triggers remained enabled. The versioned correction symmetrically
suspends and re-enables both append-only triggers inside the same locked
transaction. PR 146, its CI, same-SHA review, merge commit, and post-merge CI
were GREEN before a retry was permitted.

